  "thesis": "This strategy uses the Opening Range Breakout (ORB): it enters when price breaks the high/low of the first 15-minutes of trading\u301010\u2020L48-L56\u3011. The idea is early volatility (reflecting overnight news and institutional orders) sets a directional bias, so breaking out signals continuation\u301010\u2020L137-L145\u3011. It persists because many traders wait passively, underreacting to the 'first hour' signal, and the OR levels are self-fulfilling reference points.",
